揺れたり震えたりした線で描くよ君の歌
With shaking, trembling lines, I'll draw your song.

584
00:55:07,212 --> 00:55:09,372
次も
Next,

585
00:55:09,672 --> 00:55:12,682
その次も
and the next,

586
00:55:13,202 --> 00:55:17,242
その次も まだ目的地じゃない
and the next still isn't our destination.

587
00:55:19,452 --> 00:55:25,022
夢の 景色を
The scenery of dreams...

588
00:55:25,192 --> 00:55:29,072
景色を探すんだ 宝島
searching for that scenery, Treasure Island.

589
00:55:30,302 --> 00:55:37,442
このまま君を連れて行くよ
I'll take you along with me just like this,

590
00:55:38,072 --> 00:55:43,832
丁寧に 丁寧に 丁寧に歌うと
singing carefully, carefully, carefully.

591
00:55:44,302 --> 00:55:49,902
揺れたり震えたりしたりして
Swaying and trembling,

592
00:55:50,132 --> 00:55:55,462
丁寧に 丁寧に 丁寧に歌うと 決めてたけど
singing carefully, carefully, carefully, though I had decided so—

593
00:56:44,942 --> 00:56:50,092
このまま君を連れて行くよ
I'll take you along with me just like this,

594
00:56:50,242 --> 00:56:55,742
丁寧に 丁寧に 丁寧に描くよ
drawing carefully, carefully, carefully.

595
00:56:57,192 --> 00:57:02,592
揺れたり震えたりしたりして
Swaying and trembling,

596
00:57:02,842 --> 00:57:08,642
丁寧に 丁寧に 丁寧に歌うよ
singing carefully, carefully, carefully.

597
00:57:09,492 --> 00:57:15,642
それでも君を連れて行くよ
Even so, I'll take you along with me,

598
00:57:21,592 --> 00:57:27,642
揺れたり震えたりした線で
with a line that swayed and trembled,

599
00:57:28,088 --> 00:57:35,088
描くよ 君の歌を
I'll draw your song.

